timestamp=2026-11-14T20:58:44.110Z level=INFO run=0d3e2444 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\nimport math\nobs = [5.80, 6.01, 6.96, 7.27, 7.03, 7.84]\nfor g in [1.04, 1.08]:\n    # MLE of D0 under multiplicative log-normal / normal noise std=0.05\n    log_d0 = sum(math.log(o / (g**t)) for t, o in enumerate(obs)) / len(obs)\n    d0 = math.exp(log_d0)\n    sse = sum((math.log(o / (d0 * g**t)))**2 for t, o in enumerate(obs))\n    # also test fixed d0=6.0\n    sse6 = sum((o/(6.0*g**t) - 1)**2 for t, o in enumerate(obs))\n    print(f\"g={g}: mle_d0={d0:.3f}, sse_log={sse:.5f}, sse_rel_d0=6={sse6:.5f}, preds={[round(6.0*g**t,2) for t in range(6)]}\")\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
