timestamp=2026-11-14T21:00:29.042Z level=INFO run=0d3e2444 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\n# m8..15 status at start of m11:\n# done in m8..10 = 37.18 / 140 -> remaining in m11..15 (5 months) = 102.82 training!\n# demand in m11..15 if stays 4% (m10=9.01):\ninf4 = [9.01 * (1.04**(t-10)) for t in range(11, 16)]\n# demand if switches to 8% right now at m11:\ninf8 = [9.01 * (1.08**(t-10)) for t in range(11, 16)]\nprint(\"m11..15 inf sum 4%:\", round(sum(inf4),1), \"8%:\", round(sum(inf8),1))\n# Baseline capacity in m11..15 WITHOUT Gen N or new cloud:\n# m11: 18 H + 5 ap_res = 23\n# m12: 18 H + 5 ap_res = 23\n# m13..15: 18 H + 3 ap_res = 21 * 3 = 63\nbase = 23 + 23 + 63 # = 109\nprint(\"base cap m11..15 (no Gen N):\", base)\n# With Gen N 11.5k (23 kH):\n# If loose (4k/mo = 8kH/mo): m12:+8, m13:+16, m14:+23, m15:+23 -> +70! Total = 179!\n# If tight (1.5k/mo = 3kH/mo): m12:+3, m13:+6, m14:+9, m15:+12 -> +30! Total = 139!\nprint(\"total cap loose Gen N:\", base + 70, \"vs needed 4%:\", round(102.82+sum(inf4),1), \"8%:\", round(102.82+sum(inf8),1))\nprint(\"total cap tight Gen N:\", base + 30, \"vs needed 4%:\", round(102.82+sum(inf4),1), \"8%:\", round(102.82+sum(inf8),1))\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
